(2862350, 400694, 60165, '<td valign="top">Back to bump it up. This will be the only 10 I give in this challenge.<br/> <br/>It was the only picture which really gave me that instant <i>what is this</i>, I thought a tank or something else quite big, then in a splitsecond thereafter I saw what it was - it had a great impact on me. Sharpness, color and title are also as should be, but then, I am only a newbie on all the tech stuff.<br/> <br/>You should be top 10, maybe even ribbon with this, I wish you best of luck ...</td>', 'Back to bump it up. This will be the only 10 I give in this challenge. It was the only picture which really gave me that instant what is this, I thought a tank or something else quite big, then in a splitsecond thereafter I saw what it was - it had a great impact on me. Sharpness, color and title are also as should be, but then, I am only a newbie on all the tech stuff. You should be top 10, maybe even ribbon with this, I wish you best of luck ...', '2006-09-25 03:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
