(2864176, 400703, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks kind of unpleasant and gory to me for some reason. It is definitely difficult to tell that it is an apple. I''m not drawn to the asthetic at all. I''m not seeing anything pleasing or interesting in the way of color harmony or pattern. I doesn''t appear to show much consideration for design, rather, it is merely a close-up of an apple stem.</td>', 'This looks kind of unpleasant and gory to me for some reason. It is definitely difficult to tell that it is an apple. I''m not drawn to the asthetic at all. I''m not seeing anything pleasing or interesting in the way of color harmony or pattern. I doesn''t appear to show much consideration for design, rather, it is merely a close-up of an apple stem.', '2006-09-25 19:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
