(2865602, 399731, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m just going to have to do one of these someday.  Everytime I see this I think "that''s cool".  Nice and colorful - clean, sharp...should do well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m just going to have to do one of these someday.  Everytime I see this I think "that''s cool".  Nice and colorful - clean, sharp...should do well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-26 09:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865611, 398864, 30049, '<td valign="top">Awww, man - you pulled the stem out!  ;^)  Actually makes a nice macro shot.  The lines kind of radiate back out at you, like one of those optical illusions.  Did you experiment with some color hues on this?  Blue might have been cool.  Anyway - hope this does well for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Awww, man - you pulled the stem out!  ;^)  Actually makes a nice macro shot.  The lines kind of radiate back out at you, like one of those optical illusions.  Did you experiment with some color hues on this?  Blue might have been cool.  Anyway - hope this does well for you.  Good luck.', '2006-09-26 10:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865616, 399625, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  Clever idea.  The green "dots" on the lizard dominate over the "hair" of the (cactus?).  Good use of diagonal lines for added impact.</td>', 'This is fun.  Clever idea.  The green "dots" on the lizard dominate over the "hair" of the (cactus?).  Good use of diagonal lines for added impact.', '2006-09-26 10:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865618, 398840, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is, which is cool considering that the challenge is ''Abstract Macro''.  Guessing the tip of a flower?  I like the color of the object.  Feels like it''s getting lost in the composition with the drab background.  Did you try messing with setting the B/W points on this to get the background a truer white.  Would have made the purple jump out a little more.  The object is slightly off-center, which is fine, but go even farther.  This could be a strong candidate for a diagonal layout with the tip (''Pinacle'') coming into the frame on an angle.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure what this is, which is cool considering that the challenge is ''Abstract Macro''.  Guessing the tip of a flower?  I like the color of the object.  Feels like it''s getting lost in the composition with the drab background.  Did you try messing with setting the B/W points on this to get the background a truer white.  Would have made the purple jump out a little more.  The object is slightly off-center, which is fine, but go even farther.  This could be a strong candidate for a diagonal layout with the tip (''Pinacle'') coming into the frame on an angle.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-26 10:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865622, 400675, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Clean, simple, fun to look at...  The color adds a wonderful touch to this abstract.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is nice.  Clean, simple, fun to look at...  The color adds a wonderful touch to this abstract.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-26 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
