(2865866, 398221, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the rich colors here really pretty and I like the composition too. When I was a kid we played with horseshoe crabs on the beach. Thanks for the memory.</td>', 'Love the rich colors here really pretty and I like the composition too. When I was a kid we played with horseshoe crabs on the beach. Thanks for the memory.', '2006-09-26 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865872, 399360, 327, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool what ever it is..? I think maybe a darker background would have given this more impact. The drama of the teeth is a little lost with the light background.</td>', 'This is pretty cool what ever it is..? I think maybe a darker background would have given this more impact. The drama of the teeth is a little lost with the light background.', '2006-09-26 12:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865880, 401027, 41554, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and uninteresting...</td>', 'Out of focus and uninteresting...', '2006-09-26 12:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865881, 401070, 327, '<td valign="top">fantastic color. well done.</td>', 'fantastic color. well done.', '2006-09-26 12:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865900, 400232, 41554, '<td valign="top">This must have been very hard to shoot. Nice technical work.</td>', 'This must have been very hard to shoot. Nice technical work.', '2006-09-26 12:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865907, 400749, 39144, '<td valign="top">This shot stands out from many other challenge entries because it is not 100% recognizeable at first glance. It is not however, extremely abstract, IMHO. That aside, the colors are brilliant, the focus shart, but I would have liked a little more DOF, particularly on the close tips.</td>', 'This shot stands out from many other challenge entries because it is not 100% recognizeable at first glance. It is not however, extremely abstract, IMHO. That aside, the colors are brilliant, the focus shart, but I would have liked a little more DOF, particularly on the close tips.', '2006-09-26 12:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865910, 401079, 39144, '<td valign="top">I commend you on your idea of abstract. This is very nice. The exposure is a bit on the bright side, but the composition is wonderful.</td>', 'I commend you on your idea of abstract. This is very nice. The exposure is a bit on the bright side, but the composition is wonderful.', '2006-09-26 12:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865915, 399024, 39144, '<td valign="top">A photo like this really has me torn between my right and left side of the brain. Artistically, it is a great photograph. The color combination is perfect, the focus sharp, and the subject interesting. On the other hand, my brain just screams for symmetry. The left side, how it is just a bit smaller than the right, drives me crazy! I can''t help it. However, that is not worth voting down. -10</td>', 'A photo like this really has me torn between my right and left side of the brain. Artistically, it is a great photograph. The color combination is perfect, the focus sharp, and the subject interesting. On the other hand, my brain just screams for symmetry. The left side, how it is just a bit smaller than the right, drives me crazy! I can''t help it. However, that is not worth voting down. -10', '2006-09-26 12:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865919, 400878, 39144, '<td valign="top">Needs greater DOF.</td>', 'Needs greater DOF.', '2006-09-26 12:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865922, 401040, 39144, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and nice use of limited DOF.</td>', 'Cool idea and nice use of limited DOF.', '2006-09-26 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865925, 399647, 39144, '<td valign="top">Needs greater DOF and a bit more lighting IMO.</td>', 'Needs greater DOF and a bit more lighting IMO.', '2006-09-26 12:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865930, 400793, 39144, '<td valign="top">AWESOME SHOT! How do you people come up with such creative ideas. This one is definitely a favorite! What is it? How did you do it? I''ll have to check back after the challenge. You should ribbon with this one!</td>', 'AWESOME SHOT! How do you people come up with such creative ideas. This one is definitely a favorite! What is it? How did you do it? I''ll have to check back after the challenge. You should ribbon with this one!', '2006-09-26 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865932, 400096, 39144, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting aren''t very interesting, and the DOF a little too limited.</td>', 'The colors and lighting aren''t very interesting, and the DOF a little too limited.', '2006-09-26 12:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865935, 401031, 39144, '<td valign="top">There is way too much noise in this photo, and the fringes look more like a camera mistake rather than an artful addition.</td>', 'There is way too much noise in this photo, and the fringes look more like a camera mistake rather than an artful addition.', '2006-09-26 12:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865938, 400473, 39144, '<td valign="top">I expected to see more of these this time around. I even tried it myself, but didn''t submit one. You did a nice job of keeping the gradient smooth through the color transitions. Nice work.</td>', 'I expected to see more of these this time around. I even tried it myself, but didn''t submit one. You did a nice job of keeping the gradient smooth through the color transitions. Nice work.', '2006-09-26 12:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865940, 400932, 39144, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one when I browsed through the thumbnails. Nice job and very creative.</td>', 'I really liked this one when I browsed through the thumbnails. Nice job and very creative.', '2006-09-26 12:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2865976, 400097, 36382, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a butterfly wing is it?  That is close-up.  Would have liked to have seen it sharper if possible.</td>', 'This isn''t a butterfly wing is it?  That is close-up.  Would have liked to have seen it sharper if possible.', '2006-09-26 13:14:41.000000', NULL, 1);
