(2866461, 400530, 30049, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is, but it''s very interesting to look at!  The color tone is wonderful.  Not sure about the focus on this.  The back right area is sharply focused but the immediate foreground and middleground seem soft and blurry.  If this was focused all the way thru or at least the key front areas, it would be near the top when this challenge is over.  As is, it should do alright - just missing that fine attention to detail.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t know what it is, but it''s very interesting to look at!  The color tone is wonderful.  Not sure about the focus on this.  The back right area is sharply focused but the immediate foreground and middleground seem soft and blurry.  If this was focused all the way thru or at least the key front areas, it would be near the top when this challenge is over.  As is, it should do alright - just missing that fine attention to detail.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-26 16:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
