(2866935, 400381, 63006, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Color and Focus! Just a tad bit more around the edges would have been better I think, but you may have liked this better. Either way, I think it''s great!</td>', 'Wonderful Color and Focus! Just a tad bit more around the edges would have been better I think, but you may have liked this better. Either way, I think it''s great!', '2006-09-26 20:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
