(2866938, 400995, 63006, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful Item, whatever it is, I love how you can see the reflections of the camera lens and the room in the spheres! The contrasts of the yellow and blue make for a visually interesting piece!</td>', 'This is a beautiful Item, whatever it is, I love how you can see the reflections of the camera lens and the room in the spheres! The contrasts of the yellow and blue make for a visually interesting piece!', '2006-09-26 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2866939, 397812, 63006, '<td valign="top">Smoke, right? I like how the image goes through the border on the edges instead  of the border keeping the image contained.. Means something to me I guess.</td>', 'Smoke, right? I like how the image goes through the border on the edges instead  of the border keeping the image contained.. Means something to me I guess.', '2006-09-26 20:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2866941, 399478, 63006, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this photo has it. Whatever it is. Is it a geode? I''m having fun trying to guess what these are, but this composition seems very lopsided, and the lines all lead me off the frame, while none of them lead back in, so I''m not sure I like it entirely. Good job anyway.</td>', 'I''m not sure this photo has it. Whatever it is. Is it a geode? I''m having fun trying to guess what these are, but this composition seems very lopsided, and the lines all lead me off the frame, while none of them lead back in, so I''m not sure I like it entirely. Good job anyway.', '2006-09-26 20:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2866942, 400565, 63006, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the look of this one. I''m a fan of macro photos of eyes, and this one looks like someone sculpted an iris on a beach and dug a hole in the middle. Neat!</td>', 'Wow, I really like the look of this one. I''m a fan of macro photos of eyes, and this one looks like someone sculpted an iris on a beach and dug a hole in the middle. Neat!', '2006-09-26 20:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
