(2867583, 399722, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but I find the vertical white background section a bit distracting. It takes away from the organic feel to the rest of the shot. Great idea. Did you get a release from the model?</td>', 'This is a nice shot but I find the vertical white background section a bit distracting. It takes away from the organic feel to the rest of the shot. Great idea. Did you get a release from the model?', '2006-09-27 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
