(2867600, 400578, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture. I look foward to some technical details. The color is amazing. The background is, of course, perfect for the subject, especially the clouds. The only thing that isn''t point on is that you can tell, immediately, that it''s a plant and is easily identified so the abstractness is not quite consistent with the "Abstract Macro" assignment. It''s going on my favorites list, though.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture. I look foward to some technical details. The color is amazing. The background is, of course, perfect for the subject, especially the clouds. The only thing that isn''t point on is that you can tell, immediately, that it''s a plant and is easily identified so the abstractness is not quite consistent with the "Abstract Macro" assignment. It''s going on my favorites list, though.', '2006-09-27 00:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
