(2871807, 399866, 38032, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess this is the CD in a amicrowave trick I''ve heard about.  It looks very microscopic and colorful ... but just a smidge too sharp or posterized or something -  This might bo TOO close :)  the colors ARE great though. 6</td>', 'I''m gonna guess this is the CD in a amicrowave trick I''ve heard about.  It looks very microscopic and colorful ... but just a smidge too sharp or posterized or something -  This might bo TOO close :)  the colors ARE great though. 6', '2006-09-28 08:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
