(2871826, 401131, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like that.  The luminance compliments the non-ugly specs -  I could see an image like this feeling ugly but this is quite appealing. I''m gonna guess this is inside a candle.</td>', 'I like that.  The luminance compliments the non-ugly specs -  I could see an image like this feeling ugly but this is quite appealing. I''m gonna guess this is inside a candle.', '2006-09-28 08:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
