(2871829, 400507, 38032, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Colors and shadows are beautiful here.  The focus seems just a hair off but it doesn''t kill a great, well composed  image.  7</td>', 'Cool.  Colors and shadows are beautiful here.  The focus seems just a hair off but it doesn''t kill a great, well composed  image.  7', '2006-09-28 08:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
