(2871836, 400246, 38032, '<td valign="top">The colors and textures are great.  Both true to the subject and somehow foreign.  This is one of my favorites in this challenge - it really grabs the eye.</td>', 'The colors and textures are great.  Both true to the subject and somehow foreign.  This is one of my favorites in this challenge - it really grabs the eye.', '2006-09-28 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871840, 399625, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow! amazing...wonderful composition 9</td>', 'wow! amazing...wonderful composition 9', '2006-09-28 08:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871842, 401031, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great colors here. I think this would benefit from added contrast at the center to draw the eye into the flower.  It''s hard to put a finger in this but it seems overly hazy- I really enjoy stepping back a bit and looking at this - so as far as cloors and composition it''s great - the details are just a bit fuzzy.</td>', 'Great colors here. I think this would benefit from added contrast at the center to draw the eye into the flower.  It''s hard to put a finger in this but it seems overly hazy- I really enjoy stepping back a bit and looking at this - so as far as cloors and composition it''s great - the details are just a bit fuzzy.', '2006-09-28 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2871843, 400976, 34938, '<td valign="top">wow! what is that?!!! great</td>', 'wow! what is that?!!! great', '2006-09-28 08:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
