(2871876, 400350, 15919, '<td valign="top">No part of the picture seems to be in focus which is a drawback imo.  Also there are some distracting dustspots.  But there are some interesting forms there and the composition seem alright.</td>', 'No part of the picture seems to be in focus which is a drawback imo.  Also there are some distracting dustspots.  But there are some interesting forms there and the composition seem alright.', '2006-09-28 08:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
