(2872306, 401062, 62187, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo is the essence of the challenge. I get the feeling that I''m up close to something and I can''t even begin to guess what it is. It also shows many different skills in photography. Great job...keep up the good work...good luck...here''s a 10.</td>', 'To me, this photo is the essence of the challenge. I get the feeling that I''m up close to something and I can''t even begin to guess what it is. It also shows many different skills in photography. Great job...keep up the good work...good luck...here''s a 10.', '2006-09-28 11:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2872314, 400904, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s abstract macro...10</td>', 'It''s abstract macro...10', '2006-09-28 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2872322, 401072, 62187, '<td valign="top">If you would have given it a different title I would never have guessed it was a radio. I like the focus...cough...(wink)...great job!</td>', 'If you would have given it a different title I would never have guessed it was a radio. I like the focus...cough...(wink)...great job!', '2006-09-28 11:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
