(2874538, 400941, 66262, '<td valign="top">I think the green works very well with the gray, but the green backdrop seems to bleed into the feather at the edges.  Would really pop out if you could get a sharper separation of color between the two.</td>', 'I think the green works very well with the gray, but the green backdrop seems to bleed into the feather at the edges.  Would really pop out if you could get a sharper separation of color between the two.', '2006-09-29 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
