(2874647, 399472, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Very nice textures. Great contrast. Too bad about the obscure title which distracts.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Very nice textures. Great contrast. Too bad about the obscure title which distracts.', '2006-09-29 01:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
