(2874663, 400559, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice! <br/>A suggestion for improvement: Perhaps if you''d left the trail of ink towards the rear... I noticed a very shallow DOF - the ink trail (a.k.a the written curved or wiggly line) would have dissipated in the background because of such DOF. Anyway, I like it even as such.</td>', 'Very nice! A suggestion for improvement: Perhaps if you''d left the trail of ink towards the rear... I noticed a very shallow DOF - the ink trail (a.k.a the written curved or wiggly line) would have dissipated in the background because of such DOF. Anyway, I like it even as such.', '2006-09-29 01:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2874667, 400949, 5112, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Good macro/abstract.  Very crisp and clean.</td>', 'Cool!  Good macro/abstract.  Very crisp and clean.', '2006-09-29 01:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2874669, 399582, 29269, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''ve seen telescope photos on DPC before, but I think that this is the first microscope one! (Correct me if I''m wrong!)<br/>Deserves a 10! for the true abstract AND macro at the same time.</td>', 'Wow! I''ve seen telescope photos on DPC before, but I think that this is the first microscope one! (Correct me if I''m wrong!)Deserves a 10! for the true abstract AND macro at the same time.', '2006-09-29 01:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2874673, 400602, 29269, '<td valign="top">You should license this photo in a form of thumb for people to insert in their comments...[thumb]400602[/thumb]</td>', 'You should license this photo in a form of thumb for people to insert in their comments...[thumb]400602[/thumb]', '2006-09-29 01:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2874678, 401027, 29269, '<td valign="top">This seems out of focus, or with severe camera shake. I''m not sure if it wasn''t intended effect so I won''t tell you how to fix it, but I can tell you that it does not appeal to me.</td>', 'This seems out of focus, or with severe camera shake. I''m not sure if it wasn''t intended effect so I won''t tell you how to fix it, but I can tell you that it does not appeal to me.', '2006-09-29 01:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
