(2876848, 400919, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful! I love the beautiful colors and intricate details. The swirling shapes lead your eyes all through the image, and they keep finding more and more to see! Very well done, and a great big 10 from me.</td>', 'This is wonderful! I love the beautiful colors and intricate details. The swirling shapes lead your eyes all through the image, and they keep finding more and more to see! Very well done, and a great big 10 from me.', '2006-09-29 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
