(2876924, 400607, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why I love this so much, but I do. Let''s see... it has great texture, deep rich colors, that eye just looks so slick and glassy and world-like... the dof nose gives the picture a 3-dimensional quality.. oh... and what a pretty kitty cat! 10</td>', 'I don''t know why I love this so much, but I do. Let''s see... it has great texture, deep rich colors, that eye just looks so slick and glassy and world-like... the dof nose gives the picture a 3-dimensional quality.. oh... and what a pretty kitty cat! 10', '2006-09-29 23:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876928, 400863, 50695, '<td valign="top">somehow you have managed to be saturated and decadent without crossing the border into grotesque, as so many similar photos do. You are dancing on the border, though. I call it edgy. Edgy is good. Fork you! 10</td>', 'somehow you have managed to be saturated and decadent without crossing the border into grotesque, as so many similar photos do. You are dancing on the border, though. I call it edgy. Edgy is good. Fork you! 10', '2006-09-29 23:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876938, 400835, 50695, '<td valign="top">This also would have been great for the no subject challenge. It is a minimalist masterpiece, you could not have shown one pixel less of the creature without still giving a sense of the creature. I feel like I can see it even though I can''t. Your title reminds me that the creature is also looking at me, adding another dimension. 10</td>', 'This also would have been great for the no subject challenge. It is a minimalist masterpiece, you could not have shown one pixel less of the creature without still giving a sense of the creature. I feel like I can see it even though I can''t. Your title reminds me that the creature is also looking at me, adding another dimension. 10', '2006-09-29 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876948, 401126, 50695, '<td valign="top">mysterious rather than merely unrecognizable. A forest of the mind. 10</td>', 'mysterious rather than merely unrecognizable. A forest of the mind. 10', '2006-09-29 23:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876953, 399345, 50695, '<td valign="top">good title. There is truly a sense of winter in this picture. I just love the texture and am very curious how you achieved it, and what this is. Cinematic and beautiful.</td>', 'good title. There is truly a sense of winter in this picture. I just love the texture and am very curious how you achieved it, and what this is. Cinematic and beautiful.', '2006-09-29 23:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876956, 400808, 50695, '<td valign="top">In the world of drawing we always talk about having an expressive line, achieved through variation in width and variations in darkness, accomplished by varying the speed and pressure of your arm. What you have here is a very expressive line. 9</td>', 'In the world of drawing we always talk about having an expressive line, achieved through variation in width and variations in darkness, accomplished by varying the speed and pressure of your arm. What you have here is a very expressive line. 9', '2006-09-29 23:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876962, 400978, 50695, '<td valign="top">This isn''t very abstract. The background is abstract, but the leaves are highly recognizable and have all sorts of symbolic and sentimental associations. In fact, they bring this picture to life. It feels as though they are swirling in a frozen vortex. It somehow becomes a meditation on memory and loss, but also what is retained. And I can''t bring myself to vote less than 9 for this.</td>', 'This isn''t very abstract. The background is abstract, but the leaves are highly recognizable and have all sorts of symbolic and sentimental associations. In fact, they bring this picture to life. It feels as though they are swirling in a frozen vortex. It somehow becomes a meditation on memory and loss, but also what is retained. And I can''t bring myself to vote less than 9 for this.', '2006-09-29 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876968, 400879, 50695, '<td valign="top">closed eye as fruit. as far as I know, this is a strikingly original notion, at least photographically, and it is utterly captivating and disturbing... and perfectly executed. George Bataille would have loved this. 9</td>', 'closed eye as fruit. as far as I know, this is a strikingly original notion, at least photographically, and it is utterly captivating and disturbing... and perfectly executed. George Bataille would have loved this. 9', '2006-09-29 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876969, 401079, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely flamingo colour and texture. 8.</td>', 'That''s a lovely flamingo colour and texture. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876970, 401096, 51538, '<td valign="top">Elegant snake.  It''s hard to imagine a place in which that colour would be called camoflage! 8.</td>', 'Elegant snake.  It''s hard to imagine a place in which that colour would be called camoflage! 8.', '2006-09-29 23:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876971, 400770, 51538, '<td valign="top">Subtle in many ways. 8.</td>', 'Subtle in many ways. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876972, 400684, 51538, '<td valign="top">Peeking around the corner.  It''s a nice angle on the challenge. 8.</td>', 'Peeking around the corner.  It''s a nice angle on the challenge. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876973, 400890, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice familiar texture from close up. 8.</td>', 'Nice familiar texture from close up. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876974, 397696, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty bubbles and nicely abstract. 8.</td>', 'Pretty bubbles and nicely abstract. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876975, 400619, 50695, '<td valign="top">the variations in hand size and the old-timey processing make this much much better than the tiresome multi-image water drop shots that infect this shot. You show them how it''s done. This picture is emotional, ominous, beautiful. 9</td>', 'the variations in hand size and the old-timey processing make this much much better than the tiresome multi-image water drop shots that infect this shot. You show them how it''s done. This picture is emotional, ominous, beautiful. 9', '2006-09-29 23:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876976, 399609, 51538, '<td valign="top">Hard to imagine what sort of flora this might be.  Exotic. 8.</td>', 'Hard to imagine what sort of flora this might be.  Exotic. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876977, 400683, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting unknown objects. 8.</td>', 'Interesting unknown objects. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876978, 400097, 51538, '<td valign="top">Butterfly or moth "feathers"?  It is quite exotic. 8.</td>', 'Butterfly or moth "feathers"?  It is quite exotic. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876979, 400915, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perfect forms.  Nice observation and photo. 8.</td>', 'Perfect forms.  Nice observation and photo. 8.', '2006-09-29 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876981, 400271, 50695, '<td valign="top">excellent. you made this as simple as it could possibly be to still retain interest, and your bravura is being punished by dpc voters, I''m sure. but you get a 9 from me. this is what harps are like in heaven.</td>', 'excellent. you made this as simple as it could possibly be to still retain interest, and your bravura is being punished by dpc voters, I''m sure. but you get a 9 from me. this is what harps are like in heaven.', '2006-09-29 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876983, 400579, 50695, '<td valign="top">rich colors and dof creates a personality out of one of your stalks, and also a sense of loneliness. 8</td>', 'rich colors and dof creates a personality out of one of your stalks, and also a sense of loneliness. 8', '2006-09-29 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876985, 400584, 50695, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, what a cute widdle poodle. It is the photographer''s job to see things in a new way, and you provide a direct and amusing example. 8</td>', 'Awwwww, what a cute widdle poodle. It is the photographer''s job to see things in a new way, and you provide a direct and amusing example. 8', '2006-09-29 23:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
