(2876994, 400946, 50695, '<td valign="top">as I said to another picture, this is a forest of the mind. and quite a disturbing forest, I must say. 8</td>', 'as I said to another picture, this is a forest of the mind. and quite a disturbing forest, I must say. 8', '2006-09-29 23:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876996, 397738, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating swirl of color. I keep thinking I will find hidden animals but I never do. Wait! Is that a ninja turtle? I love that edgy feeling of almost being able to see things. 8</td>', 'fascinating swirl of color. I keep thinking I will find hidden animals but I never do. Wait! Is that a ninja turtle? I love that edgy feeling of almost being able to see things. 8', '2006-09-29 23:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876997, 399813, 50695, '<td valign="top">It is obvious to me what this is a picture of, and yet the closeness and orientation make it seem something entirely different, a world floating in a dangerous universe... or the icy torch of the damned. 8</td>', 'It is obvious to me what this is a picture of, and yet the closeness and orientation make it seem something entirely different, a world floating in a dangerous universe... or the icy torch of the damned. 8', '2006-09-29 23:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
