(2877653, 400533, 60165, '<td valign="top">Is this a macro shot? I am not so seasoned in photography yet, so I don''t know how close one has to be. To me it looks more like an overexposed snapshot, I cannot see it is abstract and finally, it is not hard at all to see what it is ... so my guess is that you will get some DNMC''s ...</td>', 'Is this a macro shot? I am not so seasoned in photography yet, so I don''t know how close one has to be. To me it looks more like an overexposed snapshot, I cannot see it is abstract and finally, it is not hard at all to see what it is ... so my guess is that you will get some DNMC''s ...', '2006-09-30 10:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2877656, 397858, 60165, '<td valign="top">Is this a macro shot? Is it hard to see what it is, and is it abstract?<br/> <br/>I''d say you could get some DNMC''s from this  ...</td>', 'Is this a macro shot? Is it hard to see what it is, and is it abstract? I''d say you could get some DNMC''s from this  ...', '2006-09-30 10:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
