(2878126, 400951, 31533, '<td valign="top">A kiwi. Not abstract enougfh for my taste. I''m guessing you shot this with a lense reversed in front ?</td>', 'A kiwi. Not abstract enougfh for my taste. I''m guessing you shot this with a lense reversed in front ?', '2006-09-30 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
