(2885351, 399518, 64844, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xianart:</b></div><hr/><i> miss dior </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Exactly! A clasic and favorite!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Younger:</b></div><hr/><i> Strange looking diamond. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha ha, it didn''t occur to me when writing the title, that it''s diamonds that are usually called women''s best friends....</td>', 'Originally posted by xianart: miss dior   Exactly! A clasic and favorite! Originally posted by Younger: Strange looking diamond.   Ha ha, it didn''t occur to me when writing the title, that it''s diamonds that are usually called women''s best friends....', '2006-10-02 01:14:52.000000', NULL, 0),
