(2886399, 400473, 43774, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 20 finish! And for those who say it isn''t original, mine wasn''t either, I got the idea from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15212" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aaronb532</a>. And let''s face it, 90% of the images on this site aren''t original, but it''s the way they are photographed and presented that make them original and the photographer''s vision. To vote something low because it lacks originality is a poor way to vote, IMO.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 20 finish! And for those who say it isn''t original, mine wasn''t either, I got the idea from  aaronb532. And let''s face it, 90% of the images on this site aren''t original, but it''s the way they are photographed and presented that make them original and the photographer''s vision. To vote something low because it lacks originality is a poor way to vote, IMO.', '2006-10-02 08:47:08.000000', NULL, 0),
