(2886563, 401017, 62187, '<td valign="top">My goodness people...it''s abstract macro - not just macro! The challenge was ''Take a picture so close up to something that it cannot easily be identified at first glance.'' You got ripped-off as your photo CLEARLY meets the challenge FAR better then most. No offense to the photographers, it''s the voting process...come on...it''s clearly a flower, or a cat, or a baseball, or colored pencils. There is not even a change to wonder because it''s SOOO obvious! Anyway, sorry for the rant...saving your photo to favs.</td>', 'My goodness people...it''s abstract macro - not just macro! The challenge was ''Take a picture so close up to something that it cannot easily be identified at first glance.'' You got ripped-off as your photo CLEARLY meets the challenge FAR better then most. No offense to the photographers, it''s the voting process...come on...it''s clearly a flower, or a cat, or a baseball, or colored pencils. There is not even a change to wonder because it''s SOOO obvious! Anyway, sorry for the rant...saving your photo to favs.', '2006-10-02 09:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
