(2891839, 401037, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 in challenge Deb. I thought the muted colors were nice and the general composition pleasing as well. I think the upper right and lower left corners balanced each other well and fro some reason I was drawn to the upper right. Nice lines and angles. While maybe not one of your best shots it was surely stronger than a 5.1 Way to go on trying something new.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 in challenge Deb. I thought the muted colors were nice and the general composition pleasing as well. I think the upper right and lower left corners balanced each other well and fro some reason I was drawn to the upper right. Nice lines and angles. While maybe not one of your best shots it was surely stronger than a 5.1 Way to go on trying something new.', '2006-10-03 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
