(2943613, 400271, 3724, '<td valign="top"><br/>Appealing abstract composition... tempo of the gray tone &amp; white shape surely meets the specs. of your title.... a welcomed &amp; pleasant minimal contribution to the challenge, 7.</td>', 'Appealing abstract composition... tempo of the gray tone & white shape surely meets the specs. of your title.... a welcomed & pleasant minimal contribution to the challenge, 7.', '2006-10-19 11:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2947056, 399447, 32147, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by _DaveA_:</b></div><hr/><i> Ahhhhh. Now I see it. <br/>Checking back on the setup details of th shot...<br/>I thought it might be a Coke can, the logo was definitely there, but then the dots on the screening of the red printed area sure looks to me like some type of cloth material. Being fairly sure Coke is not distributing soft drinks in denim (yet), I was very confused. For a time. Still concur with my earlier opinion that it is a very well put together image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dave, just wanted to say thanks for your enthusiastic comments and support.  I appreciate you taking the time to not only comment, but also to come back and follow up.  Cheers!!</td>', 'Originally posted by _DaveA_: Ahhhhh. Now I see it. Checking back on the setup details of th shot...I thought it might be a Coke can, the logo was definitely there, but then the dots on the screening of the red printed area sure looks to me like some type of cloth material. Being fairly sure Coke is not distributing soft drinks in denim (yet), I was very confused. For a time. Still concur with my earlier opinion that it is a very well put together image.   Dave, just wanted to say thanks for your enthusiastic comments and support.  I appreciate you taking the time to not only comment, but also to come back and follow up.  Cheers!!', '2006-10-20 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 0),
