(3993524, 399813, 63269, '<td valign="top">The image is a little grainy... how did you change/enhance the color? I''ve found that when I change the color by using the hue/saturation adjustment, the image ends up grainy. :( But I love this shade of indigo blue, and it looks really neat with the white highlights against the subtle black. Neat work!</td>', 'The image is a little grainy... how did you change/enhance the color? I''ve found that when I change the color by using the hue/saturation adjustment, the image ends up grainy. :( But I love this shade of indigo blue, and it looks really neat with the white highlights against the subtle black. Neat work!', '2007-08-13 12:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4567060, 401048, 90495, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know what this was at first but my friend goog helped me out. A vegetable? Wow, I never heard of these.<br/> <br/>Great shot of it here. Love the glow and the details in the foreground.<br/> <br/>For those who want to know more about loofahs (luffa)<br/> <br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luffa" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">More info here</a></td>', 'Didn''t know what this was at first but my friend goog helped me out. A vegetable? Wow, I never heard of these. Great shot of it here. Love the glow and the details in the foreground. For those who want to know more about loofahs (luffa) More info here', '2008-03-16 08:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
